# DUNE EXPRESS: mission 20, ONE LAST RIDE, can be won with the buttons alone,
# unseen and under the time star. Pearl starts at the front and Wade up on
# the last roof, and they take a turn each: Pearl throws a crate from the
# flat car at the first guard, takes the first strongbox and climbs to the
# roof behind the roof guard; next turn she punches him, drops behind the
# crank gun for the second box and waits there; then she walks on behind the
# next car's guard, punches him, takes the third box and climbs to the last
# roof; Wade, whose turns so far were spent waiting out of sight, drops off
# the end of the roof while the last patrol looks the other way, lifts the
# fourth box and carries it to the camel, and Pearl follows.
